:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p =
style=3D'margin:0in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'>Key =
Status/Updates:</span><o:p></o:p></p><ul =
style=3D'margin-top:0in;padding-inline-start:48px' type=3Ddisc><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP 4.1.2 is in =
QA<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>A large number of package =
upgrades have merged bringing us up to date with various =
upstreams.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have started moving code out =
of core bbclass files into the function libraries to help reduce parsing =
memory use, volumes of data transfer and sstate signature data sizes. =
Help is welcome in developing further patches to improve our function =
libraries.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>The autobuilder controller has =
been relocated to deal with connectivity issues, we do have some issues =
to iron out before things are back to normal service. We were unable to =
upgrade the buildbot version as there were too many other moving =
pieces.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We are trying to upgrade =
uninative to include libgcc to deal with pthread_cancel failures.&nbsp; =
Newer versions of patchelf are proving problematic and appear to be =
causing segfaults and we&#8217;re trying to untangle this from other =
issues.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have reverted the tune for =
qemux86-64 back to corei7-64 since we still have v2 hardware that =
won&#8217;t work properly with v3 under KVM and =
similar.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>A uninative bug has been =
exposed by recent bitbake datastore improvements which could cause =
sstate to be missed/duplicated.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We merged a number of neat rust =
improvements which add on target cargo support and added automated QA =
tests for this functionality so we can ensure it continues to work and =
doesn&#8217;t regress. Thanks Alex Kiernan, we hope to see more series =
like this one!<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>CVE levels in master are =
becoming worrying again, help would be appreciated to address the open =
issues.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>The autobuilder maintenance =
window now occurs on Mondays.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have a growing number of =
bugs in bugzilla, any help with them is =
appreciated.<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p style=3D'margin:0in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></s=
pan></p><p style=3D'margin:0in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'>Ways to =
contribute:</span><o:p></o:p></p><ul =
style=3D'margin-top:0in;padding-inline-start:48px' type=3Ddisc><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l8 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>As people are likely aware, the =
project has a number of components which are either unmaintained, or =
have people with little to no time trying to keep them alive. These =
components include: patchtest, layerindex, devtool, toaster, wic, oeqa, =
autobuilder, CROPs containers, pseudo and more. Many have open bugs. =
Help is welcome in trying to better look after these =
components!<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l8 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>There are bugs identified as =
possible for newcomers to the project: <a =
href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Newcomers"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC'>https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Newcomers</spa=
n></a><o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
